#    post runs its observers synchronously on that thread. FOUND: no C# code observes "GameAppLiveShader" (none in app/gameapp/GameApp*.cs or in patches 0001-0089; the harness checks it
#    stays so), so nothing on the C# side can block that thread through it: no InvokeOnMainThread, no DispatchSync, no lock. No fix was needed there. (The other name-based observers of the
