#    ADDED, to correlate the next field log: while a game is on screen (ShowGameWindowAtBoot -> DismissGameWindow) a watchdog thread posts an empty block to the main queue every 50 ms
#    (BeginInvokeOnMainThread, asynchronous; one in flight at a time) and measures from two Stopwatch timestamps (posted, ran) how long the main thread took; over 100 ms it logs one line per
#    stall with the wall-clock time it began: "main thread stalled 230 ms at 23:41:07.512" (GameAppField.cs MainStall). Its cost on the main thread: one empty block every 50 ms.
#
